 mencari kehidupan) di muka bumi sampai waktu yang telah ditentukan\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "قَالَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱهْبِطُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/4f7d5e7fa54997620112.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "siđite", "en": "go down", "tr": "inin", "fr": "descendez", "id": "turunlah (kalian)", "ur": "اتر جاؤ", "bn": "তোমরা নেমে যাও", "fa": "فرود آیید"}}, {"text": "بَعْضُكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لِبَعْضٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَدُوٌّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَلَكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْأَرْضِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُسْتَقَرٌّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَمَتَٰعٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِلَىٰ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "حِينٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "ٱهْبِطُوا۟", "count": 4, "first": "2:36", "audio": "audio/f6dc7532bace395140f8.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"bs": "siđite", "en": "go down", "tr": "inin", "fr": "descendez", "id": "turunlah (kalian)", "ur": "اتر جاؤ", "bn": "তোমরা নেমে যাও", "fa": "فرود آیید"}}, {"arabic": "يَهْبِطُ", "count": 1, "first": "2:74", "audio": "audio/b29e5071fe98018a7ec6.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it descends", "bs": "silazi", "tr": "iner", "fr": "il descend", "id": "dia turun", "ur": "وہ اترتا ہے", "bn": "সে নামে", "fa": "فرود می‌آید"}}, {"arabic": "فَٱهْبِطْ", "count": 1, "first": "7:13", "audio": "audio/90bd7a50c1398a589c7b.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "ob